  "imagery": "The visual language is dominated by high-fidelity iPhone device-frame mockups showing the live app interface — these are the heroes, not stock photography. The mockups are rendered at near-full opacity, fanned out with slight overlap and gentle rotation, floating directly on white. Inside the mockups, the app's own UI provides all the visual richness: nutrition data, food photos, macro rings, and colorful category tags. The only photographic content is user-submitted food imagery visible within the app's 'Scan Your Food' camera screen. No lifestyle photography, no abstract illustrations, no decorative graphics. The brand identity is carried entirely by the custom typeface, the orange/green/dark color system, and the app's own interface.",
